<p>The <strong class="selflink">Core Game Resources</strong> module, also referred to simple as "core", is fundamental to all modules created using the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Dragon%20Age%20Toolset" title="Dragon Age Toolset (page does not exist)">Dragon Age Toolset</a>. It contains all of the core <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Designer%20Resources" title="Designer Resources">designer resources</a> which form the foundation of every <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Dragon%20Age%20-%20Origins" title="Dragon Age: Origins (page does not exist)">Dragon Age: Origins</a> module, including the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Single%20Player%20Campaign" title="Single Player Campaign (page does not exist)">Single Player Campaign</a>, and as such will always appear in every module's hierarchy.
</p>
